  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3df2c01d891fe59e",
      "translationZh": "LLM 智能体真的能应付普通用户一天中的日常事务吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9559e31f93e8f57",
      "translationZh": "这个问题让我在过去几个月里读了不少关于 Android 智能体和移动端基准测试的论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d43522e3d1635f1b",
      "translationZh": "有几个现象反复出现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fc1200edab7f1b7",
      "translationZh": "大多数基准测试都在模拟器上运行，导致真实设备上的指标难以测量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3203aac13e8bb5c5",
      "translationZh": "电池、热表现和温度等重要的部署指标往往缺失。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d310da6d2bc26f52",
      "translationZh": "日常任务分散在不同的基准测试、语言和应用中，而没有形成一套一致且适用于全球用户的任务集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b0bee2ae768a4f6",
      "translationZh": "这使得我们更难评估一个智能体是否真能在真实手机上为真实用户可靠地工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12bff5246da174e5",
      "translationZh": "目前，我已经整理了一个关于移动端/Android 智能体基准测试的论文库，供大家阅读！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
